# Admin zone — the internal STAFF support dashboard on its own subdomain.
#
# The dashboard is cross-tenant (staff view/answer every org's cases). Its ONLY gate is
# Cloudflare Access + the SUPPORT_STAFF_EMAILS allowlist — the same pattern as the Umami
# analytics dashboard. Put a Cloudflare Access application in front of this hostname (Zero
# Trust → Access → Applications) restricted to your staff emails; Access then signs an
# application token for each request, which the app verifies (lib/auth/access-jwt.ts) against
# CF_ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN and that application's AUD tag in CF_ACCESS_AUD before reading the
# staff email from it. In production the app admits nobody until both are set. Do not expose
# this hostname without an Access app in front.
#
# OPT-IN self-host template:
#   1. Run an `admin` service (the apps/admin image) in your compose stack
#      (COMPOSE_PROFILES=admin).
#   2. Copy this file next to the active Caddyfile as `admin.caddy`.
#   3. Uncomment `import admin*.caddy` in that Caddyfile.
#   4. Replace admin.alethialabs.io with your real staff subdomain and add the
#      matching Cloudflare Access application.

admin.alethialabs.io {
	reverse_proxy admin:3000
}
